# ==============================================================================
# BetterYou - Fitness, Nutrition Vision & Ingredient Toxicity App
# Environment Configuration
# ==============================================================================

# Google Gemini API Key for Multimodal Food Vision & Ingredient Label OCR
# 1. Obtain a free API key at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# 2. Copy this file to '.env' or '.env.local':
#    cp .env.example .env.local
# 3. Replace the placeholder value below with your actual Gemini API key.
# Note: Variables prefixed with EXPO_PUBLIC_* are exposed to client-side code in Expo.
EXPO_PUBLIC_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# OpenFoodFacts API does not require an API key, but uses a polite User-Agent
# configured in src/services/barcodeService.ts
